<Page title="About ZentaPDF – Free, Private PDF & Image Tools" description="ZentaPDF offers free PDF and image tools that run entirely in your browser. Learn why we built a private alternative where your files never leave your device." h1="About ZentaPDF" path="/about/">
  <p>ZentaPDF is a free collection of online tools for working with PDF files and images — merging, splitting, converting and compressing.</p>
  <p>Most online PDF tools upload your documents to their servers. We think that is unnecessary for everyday tasks, and risky for contracts, invoices, ID scans and other private papers. So every ZentaPDF tool runs <strong>inside your web browser</strong>. Your files are never uploaded, stored or seen by anyone else.</p>
  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Privacy first</strong> — your files stay on your device.</li>
    <li><strong>Free for everyone</strong> — no sign-up, no watermarks, no daily limits. The site is supported by a small number of ads.</li>
    <li><strong>Simple and fast</strong> — one clear page per task that works on any computer or phone.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>ZentaPDF is part of the Zenta family of free online tools, alongside <a href="https://zentacalculator.com/">Zenta Calculator</a>.</p>
  <p>Questions or ideas? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</Page>
